# Input
```graphql
query user {
  user {
    id
  }
}

query user {
  me {
    id
  }
}

mutation updateUser {
  updateUser {
    id
  }
}

mutation updateUser {
  updateProfile {
    name
  }
}

mutation updateUser {
  updateSettings {
    theme
  }
}

```

